# 仮身一覧の中の仮身から開いた仮身一覧で、背景色変更の「仮身属性と同じ」を選ぶと、
# ウインドウの背景がその仮身の今の表示領域背景になる(design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py.
# C, an empty figure, and P, a figure holding a link to C whose 表示領域背景 is 00c000, are
# made (mkbig, xmlbig: eeeeeeee-... stands for C) and given to 仮身一覧 (apps). P is opened
# with the process (pcab); C, opened by a double press on its link, is another process of
# 仮身一覧 given that link (DT_F_LINK). C is a copy of 画用紙, whose metadata keeps the
# paper ffffff: C opens white. 背景色変更 (表示, its third row) opens the desktop's pop-up
# at the pointer, held to the foot of the screen: red (the chart's fourth row) is kept as
# C's paper. Opened again (表示 under the pointer, as chosen last) with 仮身属性と同じ (the
# switch under the chart) put on, the metadata keeps no paper and C is laid on the link's
# 00c000, also after the notice that the desktop wrote the metadata (OB_E_CHANGE). C is
# moved aside by its title bar; in P, 仮身操作, 属性変更 of the link (its 表示領域背景's
# colour pressed, blue of the chart, Enter, 設定) changes the link in P's record: the
# desktop tells C at once, before P saves (C asked to be told, DT_RQ_LINK_WATCH; P named
# the link with DT_RQ_ATTR, DT_F_LINK), and C is drawn blue. Saved (Ctrl+S), C reads the
# link from P's record as well (OB_E_CHANGE of P), blue still. Before that, 再表示 of C
# (表示, its second row) asks the desktop for the link as it is now (DT_RQ_LINK_WATCH
# again: the look last told), not the copy C opened with: blue. Both are closed.
# Keys: Enter 28, Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
mkbig fig 1 0
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><figure></figure></tad>
xmlbig
apps big virtual-object-list
mkbig fig 1 0
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><figure>
xml <link id="eeeeeeee-eeee-eeee-eeee-eeeeeeeeeeee_0.xtad" vobjid="01a0d8c4-ca00-7000-8000-0000000000c1"
xml vobjleft="20" vobjtop="20" vobjright="180" vobjbottom="39" height="19" chsz="14" frcol="#000000"
xml chcol="#000000" tbcol="#ffffff" bgcol="#00c000" pictdisp="true" namedisp="true" framedisp="true"/>
xml </figure></tad>
xmlbig
apps big virtual-object-list
logmark
pcab big
expectsincein 60 cabinet: opened 画用紙 shapes 1 links 1
wait 800
shot cps_p
